    "name": "Everloop",
    "steam_appid": 2843410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843410/extras/099e7c0b39d9f84a3d9f945f66323827.avif?t=1741473050\" width=616 height=85 /></span><br><br><strong>You are trapped in an endless hallway. Observe your surroundings carefully to reach your destiny.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stay alert to anomalies.<br></li><li>When you encounter an anomaly, go back.<br></li><li>If you do not find anomalies, move forward.<br></li><li>Every lit candle is a step towards your destiny.</li></ul><br><br>In Everloop, you find yourself trapped in an endless hallway, where every step and glance are crucial to unraveling the path to your destiny. A journey of observation, reflection, and discovery. Where reality intertwines with the surreal, your perception is your greatest ally.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Detailed Exploration:</strong> Navigate through a mysterious corridor, filled with details and secrets waiting to be discovered. Each element of the environment could be the key to moving forward or a sign to retreat.<br></li><li><strong>Mysterious Anomalies:</strong> Stay alert to any changes in your surroundings. Anomalies are both a challenge and a guide, bringing you closer to freedom or casting you back to the start.<br></li><li><strong>Important Decisions:</strong> Choose wisely when to advance or retreat. Each decision impacts your path and will reveal new secrets.<br></li><li><strong>Anomaly Codex:</strong> Discover and delve into the lore of Everloop with the Anomaly Codex, a detailed compilation of all the anomalies you will encounter, offering insights and stories that enrich the game experience and deepen the mystery of the infinite hallway.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843410/extras/74d1c6aaf843d8e59662c28403b10d4f.avif?t=1741473050\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br></li><li><strong>Visible Progress:</strong> With every candle lit, you are one step closer to solving the mystery of the corridor and reaching your destiny. Each flame is a milestone in your journey.<br></li><li><strong>Play Time:</strong> 15-60 minutes</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843410/extras/099e7c0b39d9f84a3d9f945f66323827.avif?t=1741473050\" width=616 height=85 /></span><br><br><strong>You are trapped in an endless hallway. Observe your surroundings carefully to reach your destiny.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stay alert to anomalies.<br></li><li>When you encounter an anomaly, go back.<br></li><li>If you do not find anomalies, move forward.<br></li><li>Every lit candle is a step towards your destiny.</li></ul><br><br>In Everloop, you find yourself trapped in an endless hallway, where every step and glance are crucial to unraveling the path to your destiny. A journey of observation, reflection, and discovery. Where reality intertwines with the surreal, your perception is your greatest ally.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Detailed Exploration:</strong> Navigate through a mysterious corridor, filled with details and secrets waiting to be discovered. Each element of the environment could be the key to moving forward or a sign to retreat.<br></li><li><strong>Mysterious Anomalies:</strong> Stay alert to any changes in your surroundings. Anomalies are both a challenge and a guide, bringing you closer to freedom or casting you back to the start.<br></li><li><strong>Important Decisions:</strong> Choose wisely when to advance or retreat. Each decision impacts your path and will reveal new secrets.<br></li><li><strong>Anomaly Codex:</strong> Discover and delve into the lore of Everloop with the Anomaly Codex, a detailed compilation of all the anomalies you will encounter, offering insights and stories that enrich the game experience and deepen the mystery of the infinite hallway.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843410/extras/74d1c6aaf843d8e59662c28403b10d4f.a